                <p>Retrieve targeted rows before joining the full order pathway.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <ol class="sql-task-list">
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.3.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">WHERE</span>
                </div>
                <p>List all lunch products that cost more than <code>4.00</code>.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.3.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">AND / OR</span>
                </div>
                <p>Show every customer from house <code>Ash</code> or <code>Oak</code>, ordered alphabetically by name.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.3.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">BETWEEN</span>
                </div>
                <p>Find order headers paid by <code>Account</code> between <code>2026-03-05</code> and <code>2026-03-12</code>.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.3.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">DISTINCT</span>
                </div>
                <p>Return every distinct payment method used in the canteen.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </section>

