            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.3.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">JOIN 2 tables</span>
                </div>
                <p>Show the customer name and order date for all orders placed by <code>Zara Ahmed</code> or <code>Mina Patel</code>.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.3.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">JOIN 4 tables</span>
                </div>
                <p>Display every order line with <code>OrderID</code>, customer name, product name, and quantity.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.3.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">Filter joined data</span>
                </div>
                <p>Show only drink items sold on or after <code>2026-03-07</code>.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="sql-task">
                <div class="sql-task-top">
                    <span class="sql-task-tag">A3.3.2</span>
                    <span class="sql-task-focus">JOIN + ORDER BY</span>
                </div>
                <p>List every product bought by <code>Aisha Rahman</code>, including the order date, ordered from earliest to latest.</p>
            </li>
